<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Nike estimates cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Nike estimates cut.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist Wednesday cut its earnings estimates for Nike Inc after the maker of sports shoes and apparel reported earnings for its fourth quarter fiscal 1997, ended May 31.</p>
<p>-- cut Q1 fiscal 1998 to $0.88/share from $0.92/share, but left a revenue forecast of $2.8 billion unchanged. Cut fiscal year 1998 to $3.00/share on revenue of $10.7 billion from $3.24/share on revenue of $10.9 billion.</p>
<p>-- maintained hold rating.</p>
<p>-- said expects lower gross margins and continued brand investments ahead.</p>
</text>
